# PMRoo manual test — Chat API payload

Use when building **`POST /chat/api/chat`** for **`user_type: property_manager`**. Pair with **`.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/test/y-tst-e2e-pmroo.mdc`** (or **`.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/test/y-tst-e2e.mdc`** → Q0 = PMRoo) for environment, verification, and reporting.

---

## Local mock (default)

Use after **`make mp-mock-e2e-up`**. No external HTTP except localhost.

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| **Host** | `http://localhost:8800/chat/api/chat` |
| **Auth** | Omit `auth_bearer` / `Authorization` (`ENVIRONMENT=dev` in smoke overlay) |
| **WO source** | Mock seed in `cursor_workspace/e2e_seed` (from `make mp-mock-seed`) |

**Default seed WO** (from [`mp_mock/fixtures/example/work_orders/158220.json`](../../../mp_mock/fixtures/example/work_orders/158220.json)):

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| `client_id` | `198` |
| `work_order_number` | `158220-1` |
| `job_token` | `E2E-MOCK-158220` |
| `workOrderId` | `158220` |

### Standard payload (local mock, non-streaming)

```json
{
  "user_id": "pm-e2e-test",
  "session_id": "<NEW uuid per trial>",
  "user_type": "property_manager",
  "source": "Web App",
  "client_id": 198,
  "context_info": "",
  "stream": false,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "for #158220-1 tenant is home tomorrow 2–4pm. Please have vendor call tenant.",
      "meta_data": {
        "attachments": []
      }
    }
  ],
  "meta_data": {
    "client_id": 198,
    "work_order_number": "158220-1",
    "job_token": "E2E-MOCK-158220",
    "location_id": null,
    "session_id": "<same uuid as top-level session_id>",
    "source": "Web App"
  }
}
```

### curl template (local mock)

```bash
SESSION="$(uuidgen)"
curl -sS "http://localhost:8800/chat/api/chat" \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d "{
    \"user_id\": \"pm-e2e-test\",
    \"session_id\": \"${SESSION}\",
    \"user_type\": \"property_manager\",
    \"source\": \"Web App\",
    \"client_id\": 198,
    \"stream\": false,
    \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"<scenario text>\"}],
    \"meta_data\": {
      \"work_order_number\": \"158220-1\",
      \"job_token\": \"E2E-MOCK-158220\",
      \"client_id\": 198,
      \"session_id\": \"${SESSION}\",
      \"source\": \"Web App\"
    }
  }"
```

### Sanity checks (local mock)

Before send:

```bash
curl -sS "http://localhost:8099/api/WorkOrder/ById/158220"
```

Expect JSON with `woNumber`, `jobToken`, `clientId` matching payload `meta_data`. If 404, run **`make mp-mock-seed`** and confirm `cursor_workspace/e2e_seed` is populated.

**Attachments (local-only):** prefer **no files** (Q5=`0`). Real S3 upload via **`.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/marketplace/y-upload-photo.mdc`** hits AWS — opt-in only.

