## Required conventions (all environments)

| Field | Rule |
|-------|------|
| **`session_id`** | **New UUID per trial** — duplicate at top-level **and** inside `meta_data` |
| **`stream`** | `false` for scripted asserts; `true` only when testing SSE UI |
| **`source`** | `Web App` or `Chrome Extension` for production-like PM; `Test` or `API` for isolated threads |
| **`auth_bearer`** | Required on **remote** testing API only; omit for local mock |
| **`work_order_number`** | Set when testing WO-scoped context/action; must match seed (mock) or real WO (remote) |
| **`job_token`** | UUID from MP URL `request-id=` (remote) or mock seed `E2E-MOCK-*` (local) |
| **`context_info`** | Leave **empty** for full E2E (do not pre-fill — skips normal context assembly) |

---

## Multi-turn flows

Send **one HTTP request per turn** (or one message array per turn policy your script uses). Common patterns:

| Pattern | Turns |
|---------|--------|
| **Single-shot mixed intent** | 1 user message → expect 2 tool calls same turn |
| **Confirm “yes”** | Turn 1: offer → Turn 2: `yes` — must **not** re-register CC |
| **Add more context** | Follow [`pm_action_request_context.md`](../../../services/roo/app/prompts/skills/pm_action_request_context.md) bundle rules |

Keep **`session_id` constant** across turns of the **same** scenario; still use a **fresh** session per **trial** in N-run stats.

