## Attachments (opt-in remote)

When the test includes files and user opted into remote/S3:

1. Upload via **`.cursor/y-generative-search/y-generative-search-rules/marketplace/y-upload-photo.mdc`** (`pmroo/` path under `docs-dev/`)
2. Attach to **user** message `meta_data.attachments`:

```json
{
  "originalFileName": "invoice.pdf",
  "fileName": "<guid>.pdf",
  "fileUrl": "https://tulumarketplace.s3.amazonaws.com/docs-dev/pmroo/<guid>.pdf",
  "contentType": "application/pdf",
  "fileSize": 245760,
  "fileHash": "<sha256>"
}
```

Per skill: file + neutral message → auto Context Capture; file + action → auto Action Request.

